{"meetingId": "806", "tickets": [{"title": "Complete one-time IRA withdrawal for remodel deposit", "text": "Complete the $38,000 gross withdrawal from Dorian Pebblefizz’s traditional IRA at Velvet Acorn Custody and send it to Teacup Comet Bank checking for the first contractor deposit.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-08-15", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "Dorian asked for a $38,000 gross distribution from the traditional IRA at Velvet Acorn Custody to be sent to Teacup Comet Bank checking for the first contractor deposit, and they agreed to complete the one-time IRA withdrawal by 2025-08-15."}, {"title": "Adjust recurring IRA distribution instructions", "text": "Raise Dorian Pebblefizz’s regular IRA cash flow from $4,000 gross per month to $6,500 gross per month. Document the revised bank destination and withholding assumptions before the next payment cycle.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-08-20", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": "edf2fbce-5c49-5e58-9961-8db31aa328b7", "subTasks": [], "evidence": "Dorian also asked to raise the regular IRA cash flow from $4,000 gross per month to $6,500 gross per month and to document the revised bank destination and withholding assumptions before the next payment cycle; they agreed to complete the recurring IRA distribution adjustment by 2025-08-20."}, {"title": "Complete address and residency update workflow", "text": "Use this workflow when a client reports a new mailing address, tax residency change, seasonal residence, or household relocation. Confirm the effective date, update advisory records, and identify planning consequences for tax-aware investment management, retirement income distributions, and account communications.

Dorian Pebblefizz and Elena Pebblefizz moved from Portland, Oregon, to Henderson, Nevada, in June 2025. The Henderson home is now the household’s primary residence. Confirm the effective date, update advisory records, and identify planning consequences for tax-aware investment management, retirement income distributions, and account communications.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": "2025-08-22", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": "24021c5e-be89-5d42-9140-abb9dc028eee", "subTasks": [{"title": "Confirm move details and documentation", "text": "Collect the new mailing address, physical residence, prior address, effective date, seasonal residence notes, and any supporting documentation the client is comfortable providing.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": null, "assigneeId": null}, {"title": "Update internal records and communication preferences", "text": "Update CRM, household profile, statement delivery preferences, meeting location notes, and any compliance-required address fields.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": null, "assigneeId": null}, {"title": "Review planning impacts", "text": "Check whether the move affects state tax assumptions, retirement distribution withholding, municipal bond exposure, estate document jurisdiction, insurance coverage, or advisor registration requirements.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": null, "assigneeId": null}, {"title": "Confirm completion with client", "text": "Send a brief confirmation summarizing the updates made and any follow-up items the client should address with tax, legal, or account providers.", "priority": "low", "dueDate": null, "assigneeId": null}], "evidence": "The move from Oregon to Nevada requires advisory records, mailing information, meeting location notes, and retirement distribution withholding assumptions to be updated using the new residency facts Dorian provided, and they agreed to complete those updates by 2025-08-22."}, {"title": "Address Oregon withholding discrepancy on IRA payments", "text": "Address the discrepancy between the custodian record showing Oregon state withholding and Dorian Pebblefizz’s expectation of no Oregon withholding on future IRA payments. Confirm the correct withholding state for the recurring distribution.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-08-29", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "The custodian record still shows Oregon state withholding on the recurring IRA distribution even though Dorian described the Henderson home as the current primary residence and did not expect Oregon withholding on future payments; they agreed to address the Oregon withholding discrepancy on IRA payments by 2025-08-29."}, {"title": "Check IRA ACH deposit timing and bank instruction history", "text": "Check the payment timing and bank instruction history for the recent IRA ACH deposit that reached Teacup Comet Bank later than expected.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-08-18", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "They agreed that the payment timing and bank instruction history need to be checked by 2025-08-18."}, {"title": "Complete distribution and tax planning deadline review", "text": "Complete the year-end cash flow and withholding review with Tobin Mossbutton of Amber Teapot Tax Services. Use the household’s higher IRA withdrawals, possible Portland sale proceeds, and Elena Pebblefizz’s expected 2025 wages of about $28,000 as inputs before final estimated tax planning.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-11-14", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "The household’s higher IRA withdrawals, possible Portland sale proceeds, and Elena’s wages were identified as inputs for a year-end cash flow and withholding review with Tobin Mossbutton before final estimated tax planning, and they agreed to complete the distribution and tax planning deadline review by 2025-11-14."}, {"title": "Request and organize estate document copies", "text": "Ask the client to provide current copies of core estate documents, including will, revocable trust if applicable, powers of attorney, health care directives, beneficiary designations, trustee or executor contact information, and any recent amendment pages. Store received documents according to firm procedures and note missing items for follow-up.

Collect current wills, powers of attorney, trust amendment pages if applicable, and beneficiary confirmations for Dorian and Elena Pebblefizz’s recordkeeping and planning review.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": "2025-09-05", "assigneeId": "a76627e3-5ef0-5551-a608-b225e494e4cf", "templateId": "0abfb48a-c041-5167-89d9-5c914aeb4eb5", "subTasks": [], "evidence": "Because only older estate papers are available in the advisory file, they agreed that current wills, powers of attorney, trust amendment pages if applicable, and beneficiary confirmations need to be collected for recordkeeping and planning review by 2025-09-05."}, {"title": "Compare IRA distributions, taxable cash, and selective sales", "text": "Compare IRA distributions, taxable cash, and selective sales as part of the household’s cash-raising plan. Do not assume the Paper Otter Components shares in the joint taxable account are the first funding source. Review tax impact and concentration risk together.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-09-12", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "they agreed that the cash-raising plan should compare IRA distributions, taxable cash, and selective sales without assuming the employer stock is the first funding source, with the review due by 2025-09-12."}]}
